# SM100 FA4 UNKNOWN_MASK split-K suppression: without the fix, elaborating
# flash_attention with MaterializedMask (UNKNOWN_MASK) causes a COMPILE FAILURE
# because SPLITK_CANDIDATES was unconditional and split-K kernels hit the
# fa4_softmax comptime assert ("split-K (M2) supports only check_mask==False
# masks"). With the fix, SPLITK_CANDIDATES is empty for UNKNOWN_MASK masks and
# the dispatch falls through to the plain 1Q single-partition path.
