# (`pair_route_h128_cl4096_topk384` passes, `..._topk385` fails) and its split
# page rounding at np 2 (top-k 768 passes, 769 fails). `_stamp`
# builds the stamped kernels
# (`MLA_STAMP=1`) and must pass with `MLA_STAMP_ADDR` unset.
